    acceptance:['A synthetic P1 reaches the right person outside normal hours within the agreed, tested target.','A case handover retains commander, next action, evidence and decision deadline.','A metric can be recomputed from recorded timestamps; missing telemetry cannot appear as better MTTD.'],
